	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05r0102_boy1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひとと　こうかんすることで
しんかする　ポケモンが　いるんだ！▼
すっげーよな！
なんで　しんかするんだろ！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-02T07:15:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-02T07:15:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人と　交換することで
進化する　ポケモンが　いるんだ！▼
すっげーよな！
なんで　進化するんだろ！？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-02T07:15:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-02T07:15:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanではc05r0101にいた</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-02T07:15:56" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BOY1</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-02T07:15:28" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
